You should use the [configure](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/configure.html) widget:

```js
search.addWidget(
  instantsearch.widgets.configure({
    aroundRadius: 1000, // in metric meters
    aroundLatLng: '40.71, -74.01',
  })
);
```

You could also use the [searchParameters](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/instantsearch.html#struct-InstantSearchOptions-searchParameters) when instanciating InstantSearch.js.
